    - target: {fileID: 359256493739813262, guid: 3fecf9e8b70e3b34b9680efa81765bd3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '- Lanes will form a # shape.

        - Trains either move from <color=#0ff>left
        to right</color> or <color=#0ff>up to down</color>.

        - 2 trains <color=#0ff>collide</color>
        if they are on the <color=#0ff>same medium</color> (ground, air).

        -
        You can place a <color=#0ff>ramp</color> on the <color=#0ff>head of a train</color>
        to send it <color=#0ff>flying</color> for several tiles (actual amount disclosed
        in game).

        - Ramps are limited, you will only gain them when trains
        spawn.

        Make as many trains survive as possible.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1338741864404335610, guid: 3fecf9e8b70e3b34b9680efa81765bd3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
